recommend keep-going the stereo edit corner grows on the silence readers; the next ascending Lotus crux is ALES99 (pad_tail — the padded top-and-tail, keeping a chosen margin of silence at each end) carried into stereo, or the next silence-family edit (collapse_silence, smooth_runs) — crux-first, agent-doable, no gate reached, witness GREEN, width-check exit 0.
